OL,3,GNEWSA'He'll regret it': The day Alex
OL,4,AFerguson quit Aberdeen for Man Utd
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Alex Ferguson announced he was
OL,7,Fjoining Manchester United after eight
OL,8,Ftrophy-laden years at Aberdeen, there
OL,9,Fwas shock among fans.
OL,11,FThey had seen the legendary manager
OL,12,Flead the Dons to three league titles,
OL,13,Ffour Scottish Cups, the Cup Winners'
OL,14,FCup and the UEFA Super Cup.
OL,16,FOne told BBC Scotland News at the time:
OL,17,F"I think he's making the wrong move, I
OL,18,Fthink he will regret it."
