OL,3,GNEWSA'He'll regret it': The day Alex
OL,4,AFerguson quit Aberdeen for Man Utd
OL,5,
OL,6,FFerguson went on to become one of the
OL,7,Fmost successful football managers in
OL,8,Fhistory, winning 38 trophies during a
OL,9,F26-year tenure at Old Trafford.
